OL,3,GNEWSA'Ripple effect of trauma' after
OL,4,APost Office scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe daughter of a former East Sussex
OL,7,Fsub-postmaster caught up in the Post
OL,8,FOffice scandal says there is a "ripple
OL,9,Feffect" of trauma for the families of
OL,10,Fthose involved.
OL,12,FBecky Armstrong, 34, is set to seek
OL,13,Fcompensation through a scheme for
OL,14,Ffamily members.
OL,16,FHundreds were impacted because of
OL,17,Fincorrect information from the Horizon
OL,18,Fcomputer system which wrongly stated
OL,19,Fmoney was missing from branch accounts.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
